# Tailwind CSS Documentation

- For Tailwind CSS setup, implementation, debugging, and review, use the official Vite documentation as the primary reference: https://tailwindcss.com/docs/installation/using-vite
- Consult the relevant official documentation page when utility behavior or configuration is uncertain.
- Follow the Vite plugin approach used by this project.
- Keep solutions compatible with the Tailwind CSS and `@tailwindcss/vite` versions declared in `package.json`.
